Compact print removes blank lines between stored entries.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight print --density compact

========== API ==========

print({ density: 'compact' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
; Source comment
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK
2024-01-02 Closing
  Assets:Cash  -1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  1 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
; Source comment
2024-01-01 Opening
    Assets:Cash     1 SEK
    Equity:Opening  -1 SEK
2024-01-02 Closing
    Assets:Cash     -1 SEK
    Equity:Opening  1 SEK
